{"title":"2023 IMO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution（中文讲解）subtitle_in_English\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution（中文讲解）subtitle in English</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/9/1196f6f2c31589964db8256cd62edc28a0e807ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1, x_2, \\cdots , x_{2023}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"127\" height=\"13\" /> be pairwise different positive real numbers such that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/f/25fd754290b76c3cb6ee24ce96d6e2127e0fee31.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_n = \\sqrt{(x_1+x_2+ \\text{···} +x_n)(\\frac1{x_1} + \\frac1{x_2} + \\text{···} +\\frac1{x_n})}\\]\" width=\"371\" height=\"43\" />\nis an integer for every <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/5/f158f25a00a49541cdbb00e1b60a18573fbe41da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 1,2,\\cdots,2023$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"143\" height=\"17\" />. Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/8/68830fec75b013c8299ee38c1df4373082f03eeb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2023} \\ge 3034$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution.EF.BC.88.E4.B8.AD.E6.96.87.E8.AE.B2.E8.A7.A3.EF.BC.89subtitle_in_English\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution（中文讲解）subtitle_in_English\">Video Solution（中文讲解）subtitle in English</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution（中文讲解）subtitle in English\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/PcuPeV9tkhk\">https://youtu.be/PcuPeV9tkhk</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jZNIpapyGJQ\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jZNIpapyGJQ</a> [Video contains solutions to all day 2 problems]\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/b/bdbad7ba60dda501e6b1cd313ae3bf4090e8f981.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n+2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" /> in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/1/6f1a2b6b7c193f9ba2b2134a59f1da5addcfbc98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/3/fc3be04db73828946870d3ccc6d122395a4bacf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/6/1d65e83a85e1c9034a1891fa021eb5668a778132.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n+2}^2 \\\\  = (\\sum^{n+2}_{k=1}x_k)(\\sum^{n+2}_{k=1}\\frac1{x_k}) \\\\ = (x_{n+1}+x_{n+2}+\\sum^{n}_{k=1}x_k)(\\frac{1}{x_{n+1}}+\\frac{1}{x_{n+2}}+\\sum^{n}_{k=1}\\frac1{x_k}) \\\\  = \\frac{x_{n+1}}{x_{n+1}} + \\frac{x_{n+1}}{x_{n+2}} + \\frac{x_{n+2}}{x_{n+1}} + \\frac{x_{n+2}}{x_{n+2}} +  \\frac{1}{x_{n+1}}\\sum^{n}_{k=1}x_k + x_{n+1}\\sum^{n}_{k=1}\\frac1{x_k} + \\frac{1}{x_{n+2}}\\sum^{n}_{k=1}x_k + x_{n+2}\\sum^{n}_{k=1}\\frac1{x_k} + (\\sum^{n}_{k=1}x_k)(\\sum^{n}_{k=1}\\frac1{x_k}) \\\\ = \\frac{x_{n+1}}{x_{n+1}} + \\frac{x_{n+1}}{x_{n+2}} + \\frac{x_{n+2}}{x_{n+1}} + \\frac{x_{n+2}}{x_{n+2}} +  \\frac{1}{x_{n+1}}\\sum^{n}_{k=1}x_k + x_{n+1}\\sum^{n}_{k=1}\\frac1{x_k} + \\frac{1}{x_{n+2}}\\sum^{n}_{k=1}x_k + x_{n+2}\\sum^{n}_{k=1}\\frac1{x_k} + a_n^2 \\\\ \\text{}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"240\" />\n</p><p>Again, by AM-GM, the above equation becomes \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7bbcdf89d3f659f260baa9de6c4381c0b73265b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n+2}^2 \\ge 4 \\sqrt[4]{(\\frac{x_{n+1}}{x_{n+1}})(\\frac{x_{n+1}}{x_{n+2}})(\\frac{x_{n+2}}{x_{n+1}})(\\frac{x_{n+2}}{x_{n+2}})} +  4\\sqrt[4]{ (\\frac{1}{x_{n+1}}\\sum^{n}_{k=1}x_k)(x_{n+1}\\sum^{n}_{k=1}\\frac1{x_k})(\\frac{1}{x_{n+2}}\\sum^{n}_{k=1}x_k)(x_{n+2}\\sum^{n}_{k=1}\\frac1{x_k}) } + a_n^2  = a_n^2+4a_n+4 = (a_n+2)^2 \\\\ \\text{}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"68\" />\n</p><p>Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a31b96b236f46ed0a69be3a3b5d4bbd85be0561d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n+2} \\ge a_{n} + 2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" /> but equality is achieved only when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/7/d77fab9dd36492c9ac7bcd9b46d72558881f3a49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x_{n+1}}{x_{n+1}},\\frac{x_{n+1}}{x_{n+2}},\\frac{x_{n+2}}{x_{n+1}},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"144\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/0/490f1893414efa37455c49ec1bd96e7d7c0eabf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x_{n+2}}{x_{n+2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"42\" height=\"38\" /> are equal. They can never be equal because there are no two equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/f/c9fe9bac98aaf5778bb70c462ec303081c9db206.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_k.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"25\" height=\"13\" />So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/2/9a2c1d7560381f88e6580f017bd7039a2c826aa4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2023} \\ge a_1 + 3\\times \\frac{2023-1}{2} = 1 + 3033 = 3034$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"358\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/e/67e2dcf8777e4ef100fbc0532484f177db7d3483.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n+1} &gt; a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"14\" /> are integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/7/aa7679465e04ee65be360fcb2abe86881f51249d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n+1} \\geq a_n + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"111\" height=\"18\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. The problem follows from the claim <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/4/e24f2b1e9d45f72c1bb74ec4ec6fafe51061417f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n+1} = a_n+1, a_{n+2} = a_{n+1}+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"246\" height=\"18\" /> is impossible for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/1/821d5b948fd2e8a82be18042d192710914b5e819.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/4/6443708f002f30b6470cb4e4b3915c1510cd37ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_0 := 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"57\" height=\"17\" />, since in this case \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/7/a47cfb1ca6fed4f4c7ed58ac5881422ab3449b15.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_{2023} = a_1 + (a_2 - a_1) + (a_3-a_2) + \\cdots + (a_{2022} - a_{2021}) + (a_{2023} - a_{2022}) \\geq 1+2+1+\\cdots + 2 + 1 = 3034. \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ (1)\\]\" width=\"766\" height=\"18\" />\nNow, suppose by contradiction the claim is false for some <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/4/d946484d474c401e0455899ce1495c0296135391.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=x_1+\\cdots+x_n, b = \\frac{1}{x_1} + \\cdots + \\frac{1}{x_n}, f(x) = bx+a/x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"427\" height=\"41\" />. Note \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/5/495bb74b1dddd9b50aabdd8fe3be2f23dcfe1690.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_{n+1} = \\sqrt{a_n^2 + f(x_{n+1}) + 1}. \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ (2)\\]\" width=\"264\" height=\"32\" />\nAlso note <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is convex, differentiable, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/8/1e8ec0dc8c44bf558fff6da08365fb72e8762c94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{d}{dx}f(x) = 0 \\iff x = \\sqrt{a/b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"227\" height=\"39\" />, in which case <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/a/2ea99e99c742528abee7962fa3fed91dc243fc4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f\\Big(\\sqrt{a/b}\\Big) = 2\\sqrt{ab} = 2a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"196\" height=\"37\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/1/8e1f25ea2e88f82b4a5d5005d74b9557fdd96392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) \\geq 2a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"89\" height=\"20\" /> with equality iff <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/d/12d2d3602d4c33c155cbb1d881b042402e303090.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\sqrt{a/b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"81\" height=\"35\" />. It follows <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/d/44d82d1d156161f71c68000867fc11eb25480d76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" /> (which we assumed to be the case) iff <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/f/d7faf4ac4a23db33a71371944c31088bb195998d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{n+1} = \\sqrt{a/b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"107\" height=\"35\" />. Similarly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/b/bdbad7ba60dda501e6b1cd313ae3bf4090e8f981.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n+2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" /> equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/c/02cdd083112c4189b631c3805ad92036817f81a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n+1}+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" /> iff \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/4/114e0a52cb4629ed8ebe2a9c8fbfd10b45d6242e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_{n+2} = \\sqrt{\\frac{x_1+\\cdots+x_{n+1}}{\\frac{1}{x_1}+\\cdots+\\frac{1}{x_{n+1}}}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{a+x_{n+1}}{b+\\frac{1}{x_{n+1}}}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{a+\\sqrt{a/b}}{b+\\sqrt{b/a}}} = \\sqrt{a/b}\\]\" width=\"507\" height=\"57\" />\nwhich contradicts <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/0/8a055860fae62602e1ed0748ee1d8eae4b8eca7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{n+2}\\neq x_{n+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" />. This shows the claim, hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p>~not_detriti\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/8KJvfxJ57MA\">https://youtu.be/8KJvfxJ57MA</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_IMO\" title=\"2023 IMO\">2023 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_IMO_Problems\" title=\"2023 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2023 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2023 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2023 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2023 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2023 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2023 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2023 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018020556\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 232/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 894/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8394/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.637      1 Template:IMO_box\n100.00%    6.637      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:24824:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018020556 and revision id 288109. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}